{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "797acb0f6237528e09348d4a152d7f7cdc77d894c4d76e6b3b8200a2b7540ade", "ja": "ライバル、だから！", "zh": "因为是劲敌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "56a9f64c6fb9a4bbd95318693ccde13409664b566c3d3ae9f4f6d43954f34e06", "ja": "詩花の圧巻のパフォーマンスに、興奮冷めや\nらない恵美と可憐。そこへ、ステージを終え\nたばかりの詩花がやってくる。3人の会話は\n弾み、今度詩花を劇場に招待しようというこ\nとに。", "zh": "看完诗花精湛的表演后，\n惠美与可怜的热情一直冷却不下来。\n此时刚结束表演的诗花过来了。\n三个人相谈甚欢，\n并决定下次要邀请诗花前往剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a143bcfdea20e10f6fe8aefcdf2f1e4eb4e6e9f2f0f39b816be5119c6233bccc", "ja": "（今日のアイサマの、全演目が終了した。\nトリの詩花のステージは、まさに圧巻のひと言だった）", "zh": "（今天偶夏的所有表演都结束了。\n诗花的压轴演出，可说是精采万分。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "975e1cdf3bcc42dfcb1b06fb661ab809fab6af658f72fb4881f5d91a475c3887", "ja": "（だが、うちのステージも目立ってたぞ！\n構成を変えたのがよかったか、この調子で明日も……）", "zh": "（不过，我们的表演也相当引人注目！\n看来变更流程的成效不错，明天也要继续保持……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "81a0a678b697f5f786bf2bdb14cd3bdc3e4c3bd08d7d4fddac912d6ebb0d1698", "ja": "あれ？　{$P$}じゃん！\nこんなところで何してんの？", "zh": "咦？这不是{$P$}吗！\n你在这里做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "83176c7628234450a83b09de706f06e9a8a7a35d398ebee33f35b798774cb7fd", "ja": "お、恵美と可憐か。何ってまあ挨拶回りだけど……\n恵美たちこそ、なんでまだ着替えてないんだ？", "zh": "哦，是惠美和可怜。我是在四处打招呼……\n惠美你们才是呢，怎么还没去换衣服？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "8d79b62bc8a0d73bdec0d3fc087588b599f6630d59f39809560deb013477581f", "ja": "にゃははっ、詩花のステージを見たら、\n落ち着かなくなっちゃってさ～。散歩してたんだ♪", "zh": "呀哈哈！因为我看完诗花的表演，\n到现在还冷静不下来～所以就出来散步啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "64671d0dc0f88b20600cf978631239baae0c7d280b354e72fc77383c65fa059b", "ja": "わ、私も……恵美ちゃんと同じで……。\nジッとしていられなくて……あれ？　くんくん……。", "zh": "我、我也是……跟惠美一样……\n觉得坐不住……咦？嗅嗅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "c9f254eb5a513c75d644404922148bb44fb9492f4afb530b2902f81c07b3a6b5", "ja": "えっ……？　あ、あれ……？\n{$P$}さん、その匂いは……？", "zh": "咦……？奇、奇怪了……？\n{$P$}先生，你身上的味道……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "20dc910884057f0f2037f935db6c9a9e55e4e1aef5f7b8b38f244c3318f5bb82", "ja": "え、匂い？　というと……ん？", "zh": "咦，味道？什么意思……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1008_201xxx", "source_sha256": "bef4e27604f6cb12aaa769b2d5d830b00f4bbfe6c1eeec2e82df3046bf580669", "ja": "恵美ちゃん可憐ちゃん、{$P$}さん！\nグリュース・ゴット♪　お疲れさまです。", "zh": "惠美、可怜，还有{$P$}先生！\nGrüß Gott♪表演辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "aa5c88511b01fa8e16eaa24d61c19c66ad5fd37f422fe6f88a3efeb6ce92c6a4", "ja": "あ、詩花さん……！", "zh": "啊，是诗花……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d716b495124f6cf56bd2a7629d898ea79c1f60606bed0a5d05c6242bb26b587b", "ja": "詩花もお疲れさま！\nトリにふさわしい、見事なステージだったな。", "zh": "诗花，你也辛苦了！\n你的表演非常精采，不愧是压轴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "33f1632fc8d9d664784c828c4a3fc491c9fcb8e605d20646c0d5746c8f3aa898", "ja": "うんうん、ホントだよね～！　……ん？", "zh": "嗯嗯，真的～！\n……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1012_201xxx", "source_sha256": "1bff7383f3d3318e83b0e7a7758f32ac8f74d2b68a8510d999fd0f90534bc6bf", "ja": "ふふっ、光栄です！　ありがとうございます♪\n恵美ちゃんと可憐ちゃんも、見てくれたんですね？", "zh": "呵呵！真是荣幸！谢谢夸奖♪\n惠美跟可怜也有来看吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "bd21b20ed32db1740f0975c155b7ac11e295480baac8e812e8096a729ffc7502", "ja": "……あ、もちろん見たよ！　今日はもう終わったのに、\nアタシもまたステージに上がりたくなっちゃった♪", "zh": "……啊，当然有看啰！明明今天的表演都已经结束了，\n但我看完后又想要再上场了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "3c15c3d0fcc6624178ac9a3d03b1467d693c4a1870560660c5c02d72251ae3b1", "ja": "本当に、すごかったです……あ、あの、詩花さんって、\n普段は、どんなレッスンをしているんですか……？", "zh": "真的非常精采……那、那个，诗花，\n你平时都做些什么训练呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1016_201xxx", "source_sha256": "e264ecdc66c18c98520d518c27cdf869f208bf4dbf74ca701fee7c03dc31393c", "ja": "みなさんと同じだと思いますよ。発声練習、\nダンスレッスン……後は、基礎体力づくりとか。", "zh": "我想应该和大家一样喔。\n发音练习、舞蹈课程……再来就是培养基础体力之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "27e81a8618d408662d192ef0cd43e5a218fd54d3c8532a74c0c930b5f82582af", "ja": "そっか……じゃあやっぱり、さ、才能なのかな……？\n私も、詩花さんみたいになりたいけど……。", "zh": "这样啊……这么说来，果、果然是才能的差别吗……？\n我也想要变得跟诗花一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1018_201xxx", "source_sha256": "5f9e8a857796caadb781a09ac481d890be5f7a61ac4918d15377a224bb9b325f", "ja": "そんな！　可憐ちゃんは、そのままでいいのに……！\n765プロのみなさんは、そのままで素敵なんです！", "zh": "怎么会呢！？可怜做你自己就行了……！\n765艺能的各位偶像，保持自己的特色就很棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1019_201xxx", "source_sha256": "2bd388dc901147a67a9bdca3d1b0a9d8c78114892b735f78d60c31c1d0f47e45", "ja": "社長には内緒ですけど……私、みなさんの\nファンなんです！　劇場に行ったこともあるんですよ♪", "zh": "这件事情不能跟我们社长说喔……\n其实，我是你们的粉丝！也有去过剧场喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "0a3ef5c096ab17606ae508a010e61bb4691c848fe3e18f39beec3698d57010ba", "ja": "えっ、うちの劇場に！？　ホント？", "zh": "什么，你来过我们剧场！？真的呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1021_201xxx", "source_sha256": "38d8be999facbccdc730b1100c4b86871046d00304f8915c32c2d7f9bafa9215", "ja": "はい♪　楽しくて、眩しくて……私の憧れたアイドル、\nそのもので！　ステージから、目が離せませんでした。", "zh": "对呀♪你们的表演好欢乐、好耀眼……\n完全就是我所憧憬的偶像！让我盯着舞台目不转睛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1022_201xxx", "source_sha256": "abc607808b69b076dd91f2119651f25058c02d7c728380dd12fe30f0696c5b76", "ja": "私は私、みなさんはみなさん、それぞれ違う輝きが\nある……ですよね？　{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "我是我、你们是你们，各自散发出不同的光芒……\n对吧？{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "cfb861a88173d5ba9cc82adaab0164a7d5a2b80daa388747de8084a5bd5b52fe", "ja": "はは……まあ、そういうことだな。", "zh": "哈哈……是啊，就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1025_201xxx", "source_sha256": "ef1f330880f17b5ecd645d9316a49af710da0d0d1a10060be6d9e9c60c542347", "ja": "それで……私からも聞いていいですか？\n恵美ちゃん達は、お休みの日に何をしているの、とか。", "zh": "那么……我也能问问题吗？\n像是惠美你们休假时都在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1026_201xxx", "source_sha256": "6da95bfadf071582204e522337580182271bf268bad925fbe06753109305ae93", "ja": "いちファンとして、とっても気になるんです♪", "zh": "身为一名粉丝，我觉得非常好奇♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "c5cf660ad54505fbe331da00b1aef95c87acfc81e18aba390aa7a18c47762d55", "ja": "え？　えっと、オフは……アタシはフツーに、\n友達とカラオケ行ったり、ファミレス行ったりかな？", "zh": "咦？这个嘛，休假时……我没什么特别的，\n就跟朋友去唱卡拉OK，或是去家庭餐厅吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "9db2e59c6ea822fce2aea9a0bd1e2f279ba10e7cd8101ee18e0f7a4c8148cf48", "ja": "わ、私は……雑貨屋さんを、見て回ったりします……。\nアロマオイルが、い、色々と、置いてあるから……。", "zh": "我、我会去……杂货店逛逛……\n因为那里有很、很多精油……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1029_201xxx", "source_sha256": "351a97eab568aebceb6f34d6583a2ab6119b92bcb694d5695265e468a58303a6", "ja": "わぁ、カラオケも雑貨屋さんも素敵です！\n可憐ちゃんはきっと、アロマにも詳しいんですね♪", "zh": "哇～卡拉OK和杂货店都好棒喔！\n我想可怜一定很懂精油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "238115045d11badc4a60dc27d88903cea5f3cc51339d82e52621b01addd0a906", "ja": "うん、可憐はすっごいよ！\nこないだもアレ、なんだっけ？　シト……シトレ……。", "zh": "嗯，可怜很厉害喔！\n之前还用那个，叫什么来着？香……香卯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "f4dd660c07a54eed9a4eb0ad02766650b4c16e1c447f3491152c3b4d08a8feaa", "ja": "ふふっ、シトロネラ？", "zh": "呵呵，香茅吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1032_020meg", "source_sha256": "82895707de9ff1e8e4bbac9aadfd84460ff500fd59c44c8fb23529c5ad250c5d", "ja": "そそ、それ！　ライブ前でも気持ちが軽くなってさ♪\nありがとね、可憐！", "zh": "对对，就是那个！让我们在演唱会前能放松心情♪\n谢啦，可怜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1033_045kar", "source_sha256": "0dd3c8622548bb2aa0ad54e2ce59d0c60fcf2d603211d79ff64f0806f30c26a4", "ja": "ううん。私の方こそ……。いつも、\n服を買うのに付き合ってくれて……ありがとう♪", "zh": "不会，我才要道谢……\n你总是陪我买衣服……谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1034_201xxx", "source_sha256": "74fa79a36863a73572fd181eb97f07981f74f5f9657b4d39106308ed36c27e80", "ja": "ふふっ……やっぱり、なかよしなんですね♪\nうらやましいです。", "zh": "呵呵……你们的感情果然很好呢♪\n真令人羡慕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1035_020meg", "source_sha256": "27e833c64793b55573c57fccdf59455996988894e6f892e2b62922f5b6c1e8f6", "ja": "え～。じゃあ今度、詩花も一緒に遊び行こうよ！\nあ……っていうか、劇場に招待したらよくない？", "zh": "会吗～不然诗花下次也跟我们一起出来玩吧！\n啊……不如这样，干脆邀请她来剧场玩吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1036_020meg", "source_sha256": "5198d71a93c554852910507b88d446f62f9a3cedc6303cec063d49892feaf2b6", "ja": "みんなも絶対喜ぶと思うし！\nね、{$P$}、いいよね！？", "zh": "大家也一定会很开心的！\n欸，{$P$}，可以吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1037_p", "source_sha256": "4428135936d03517ec5a0609c806b671cb4bfb1808a34551c3e305296a5708a0", "ja": "まあ……そうだな。詩花さえよければ。", "zh": "这个嘛……只要诗花愿意的话，可以喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1038_020meg", "source_sha256": "cb277a06a057e523f7502baee5b892701cf5f05e54ac8cda1e635324e01e2f0e", "ja": "やった～！　じゃあ後で、連絡先教えて！\n今から楽しみだな～♪　みんなのことも紹介するね！", "zh": "太好了～！那待会告诉我联络方式吧！\n真是迫不及待耶～♪到时我再跟你介绍大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1039_201xxx", "source_sha256": "d00a228d3ebe87369f98da693612acc2c0799ea61b31d4279562fbe3a0223013", "ja": "えっ……ま、待って恵美ちゃん！\nでも、それは……。", "zh": "咦……等、等一下，惠美！\n可是，那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1040_047sub", "source_sha256": "cead98131a2faa58e00800b7989568e0592363aad753a2e6d19d611032d7af33", "ja": "おーい、恵美、可憐！　そろそろ帰り支度を……\nって、詩花じゃん！？　なにしてんだ？", "zh": "喂～惠美、可怜！该收拾东西回去啰……\n咦，那不是诗花吗！？你们在做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1041_020meg", "source_sha256": "292fb5287c419c5092aaefde28b7680b1808030efe537a61e6bc35fd3c128334", "ja": "あ、昴とひなた！　ちょっと聞いてよ！\n今度、詩花が劇場に遊びに来るって！　すごくない？", "zh": "啊，是昴和日向！你们听我说！\n诗花下次要来我们剧场玩喔！不觉得很棒吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1042_047sub", "source_sha256": "28f58016238e27963519fc3337818cc76d750507e26bafac9be8dc78ceb550cc", "ja": "えっ、マジで！？　すっげー！　なあなあ、詩花って\n何でもできそうだけど、キャッチボールもできる？", "zh": "什么，真的吗！？太棒了！我问你喔，诗花，\n我觉得你好像很万能，那你会不会传接球啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1043_035hin", "source_sha256": "2c4a6cf3b87cdaf3911c3f27d85e754e29e608d80f72ff29d4c8dbd35549ba13", "ja": "うれしいねぇ！　あたしも、詩花さんに\n聞いてみたいことが、いっぱいあるんだわ。", "zh": "好开心呢～！\n我也有好多事情想请教诗花哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1046_201xxx", "source_sha256": "1aa8d9c04a1bb8e1ecfb0a7a411bd73561c99e9b3854b4ae07f8cc3d180d438a", "ja": "えっと……。\nはい……あの、私も、楽しみにしてます！", "zh": "这个……\n好的……那个，我也很期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1047_p", "source_sha256": "3e22547246a66d204139e17c775aa15045178c424a83cf5eb5a924175a559e7a", "ja": "みんな。そろそろ撤収準備じゃないか？\n早く着替えないと。", "zh": "大家，该准备撤场了吧？\n要赶快换下服装才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1048_047sub", "source_sha256": "6d24486bd8adb2726eaaecc366b6368826bcd6afa3b72ecfafe79619c4834dfc", "ja": "あ、そうそう！　だから恵美と可憐を探してたんだ。\nほら、早く行こうぜ！", "zh": "啊，对喔！所以我们才来找惠美和可怜的。\n好啦，赶快走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1049_035hin", "source_sha256": "56ee9bb8cce2cbcebc10d8d0732b3e00b8e677f4390ec2f726ea64fff80206d4", "ja": "うん！\nしたっけ詩花さん、また今度ねぇ。待ってるよぉ！", "zh": "嗯！\n那么诗花，下次见呢～！我们等你来喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1050_201xxx", "source_sha256": "fcd39390174ae2871f7a47632e3c3485a30f1b1f0e7e39e4fc0c1195f2fa3abe", "ja": "はい、また今度……。", "zh": "好的，下次见……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1051_201xxx", "source_sha256": "5e270e770aea7c6c8a24c7e84283636c17ab641397d9ee88a81deba839a1aad0", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さん。\n私……本当に、いいんでしょうか？　お邪魔して。", "zh": "但是，{$P$}先生。\n我……真的可以去吗？去打扰你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1052_p", "source_sha256": "1017a0ef414adf23256a7e4ab82c776cb33d75e618466d493ee429854791c9e4", "ja": "……やっぱり、961プロ所属のアイドルとしては、\n黒井社長に遠慮しちゃうかな？", "zh": "……果然，身为961艺能的偶像，\n你还是会顾虑到黑井社长吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1053_201xxx", "source_sha256": "60af67064dac0acb2cc019949473c25c1efdd6da9a85320eb9cc34401a0bbdb5", "ja": "はい……社長は、自分以外は相手にするな、\nって言うんです。なれ合ってはいけないって……。", "zh": "是的……社长说不要理会自己以外的人。\n说不准跟其他人厮混……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_1054", "source_sha256": "f79af94bdc9336347728d7fea6515827f1afd8a523bd1c33a0d0ac8e4f045990", "ja": "そのとおり", "zh": "他说得没错", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_2000_p", "source_sha256": "ed09f4a4d53a531da967b30e2608168fa4ebb5bc693ebf7c6006b10119506f55", "ja": "なれ合いがいけないのは、そのとおりだと思う。\nアイドルはお互いにライバルだから。", "zh": "我觉得他说不准厮混并没错。\n毕竟偶像们都互为劲敌啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_2001_p", "source_sha256": "ffc3c3bcb5c8c7aee6d0f38a23518f2bf23843d2ec790394758f3c0458ec47e0", "ja": "でも、だからこそ……\n仲よくした方がいいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "可是，正因为如此……\n只要建立情谊就行了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_2002_201xxx", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_2003_p", "source_sha256": "32056394604c146d72b174e0e47c5dfa4b259ad1b72e99bec8e7d1c00061ff66", "ja": "仲がよくなるほど、本気でぶつかり合えるから。\nほら、家族とか兄弟みたいにね。", "zh": "因为双方的情谊越好，就越能认真较劲。\n比方说，就像家人或兄弟姊妹那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_2004_p", "source_sha256": "9fa920c586c38cc5ad302087fdd317b94afc0dabbd85299398aab75edb217469", "ja": "遠慮も恐れもいらないくらい、仲のいい競争相手。\nそれが……きっと、ライバルってものだと思うよ。", "zh": "不需要客气也不用畏缩，关系良好的竞争对手。\n我觉得……劲敌肯定就是这样的关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_2005_201xxx", "source_sha256": "cd7e5a5ca7120f98f5a0fbf80a3d6bc811bb8b3d6322e8bf02f7cb62f953c216", "ja": "仲のいい……ライバル……！", "zh": "关系良好的……劲敌……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_2006_201xxx", "source_sha256": "f1dd725cae42fdd03166b6b248e817afa249a7921a51cce74eb696d584517bab", "ja": "……私、なれるでしょうか？\nみなさんと……そこまで信頼し合える、ライバルに？", "zh": "……我有办法胜任吗？\n成为和大家……如此相互信赖的劲敌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_2007_p", "source_sha256": "d064d3cfebf693fa66c56c0b07927f68926802374da6f8d9b567a039da1de950", "ja": "わからないけど、少なくとも……\nあの5人は、もう詩花が大好きみたいだったけど？", "zh": "这我也不确定，但是至少……\n那五个人已经很喜欢诗花了，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_2009_201xxx", "source_sha256": "ec24a737d84d596bbf92aec17df838522f7d8bbf0a5c16bed3324400a98d3cac", "ja": "……うれしいです。ありがとうございます♪\nじゃあいつか、本当に……劇場にお邪魔します！", "zh": "……我真的很开心，谢谢你♪\n那么总有一天，我真的会……前往剧场拜访的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_2010_201xxx", "source_sha256": "3e7f5a147cc29b5cf8f9fdd950e1b70d996bfe08cdba8666f023c46dd3f60b1b", "ja": "あ……もしよかったらお返しに、私のライブにもご招待\nしますね！　みなさんと一緒に来てくれませんか？", "zh": "啊……如果不嫌弃的话，请让我招待你来我的演唱会，\n当作回礼吧！可以请你带着大家一起来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_2011_p", "source_sha256": "1fe7671590c9403977d0b995a2f40d180b45c33e6139c1326099bb716386924b", "ja": "ああ、ぜひ！\nみんなで応援しに行くよ。コンサートライトを持って。", "zh": "好啊，我们一定会去！\n还会带着萤光棒去声援你喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0046_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_05_2012_p", "source_sha256": "4ac9050cedd21ae8c3698f0526de7ffb59e358c26b8d83af1858b64d8b7012dd", "ja": "（彼女はまだまだ伸びる。そして、うちのアイドル\nたちも……お互い、高め合っていってくれたらいいな）", "zh": "（她还会继续成长，而我们的偶像也是……\n希望双方能够持续相互激励。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
